  "_about": "First Android API level from which each JCA/JSSE standard algorithm name stays available in the platform providers, per service, taken from the 'Supported API levels' tables of the Android reference pages named in _sources. An algorithm available on early releases, removed and added back (MessageDigest SHA-224: 1-8 and 22+) is listed with the level it came back. Written from those tables (2026-10-31) without a live check: an entry not certain is \"unknown\", and an unknown or missing name never triggers the check (validation.android_api_levels). Names are matched without regard to case, as the JCA does. A Cipher transformation is looked up whole, then by its algorithm alone.",
